WEBVTT

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.296
How we became sisters.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.896
FB: Right, so about a year later,

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:07.416
Jen and I were invited to read poems
in the basement of Two Boots pizzeria.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.256
JM: Our careers had taken off!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.616
(Laughter)

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:13.520
FB: After the pizzeria reading,
we have a slice.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:17.760
I don't know why, but I tell her
something I hadn't told anyone.

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:21.976
I spent the weekend in Reno
with Nacho Velasquez.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.696
First thing she says --

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.120
JM: Did you see Nacho's little nacho?

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.056
FB: And we were friends.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.296
JM: That --

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.336
(Laughter)